      <pattern name="complete-or-throw share read before a write decision" location="src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Access/IDataverseRecordShareService.cs:25-29">Use GetPrincipalAccessOrThrowAsync whenever a write depends on the current shares.</pattern>
